WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:03,370
It's getting dark, you should go back

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,210
Lin Feng, I am different from them

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,250
I didn't plan to be a temporary worker when I came here.

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:10,370
I can do what dental surgery can do.

5
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,050
And I'm better than him

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,530
Know more clearly what you want

7
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,740
Think it through before coming in

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,140
Sold this card

9
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,340
But there's no turning back

10
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:28,410
Lin Shiyan, what time has it been and she still hasn’t come back?

11
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,550
Sister Weiwei

12
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,550
She won't really shut up with Lin Feng

13
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:34,240
Sister Weiwei

14
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,040
Sister Shi Yan burned the words before leaving

15
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,240
She said she would come back after she had a lot of work today

16
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:41,210
Let everyone not worry about talking nonsense

17
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,850
I stayed up all night the first day

18
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:43,930
What a grand scene

19
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:47,910
I'll ask her clearly when she comes back tomorrow. Let's go to bed first.

20
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:49,510
Let’s talk about it when the person comes back tomorrow
